PECTRUM OF INSURANCE PRODUCTS AND SERVICES TO BUSINESSES ENGAGED IN DEVELOPING OR EMPLOYING NEW TECHNOLOGIES AND PROCESSES THAT HELP REDUCE THE DEPENDENCE ON CARBON.'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2023-01-04 09:00:00', 'title': "STUDENT FREEDOM INITIATIVE ANNOUNCES CISCO'S DEPLOYMENT OF WIRELESS 5G SERVICE AT CLAFLIN UNIVERSITY", 'text': 'ORANGEBURG, S.C.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TODAY, STUDENT FREEDOM INITIATIVE (“SFI”) AND CISCO ANNOUNCED WIRELESS 5G INTERNET SERVICE DEPLOYMENT AT CLAFLIN UNIVERSITY.'}{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-01-04 07:30:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP REPORTS RECORD AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME OF 23.3 MILLION CONTRACTS TRADED IN 2022, AN INCREASE OF 19%', 'text': "-\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 EQUITY INDEX ADV GREW 39% FOR THE YEAR AND 26% IN Q4 -\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 INTEREST RATE ADV UP 18% ANNUALLY, DRIVEN BY RECORD SOFR VOLUME AND OI -\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 HIGHEST-EVER Q4 ADV CHICAGO , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY REPORTED ITS FULL-YEAR, Q4 AND DECEMBER 2022 MARKET STATISTICS, SHOWING IT REACHED A RECORD AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME (ADV) OF 23.3 MILLION CONTRACTS DURING THE YEAR, AN INCREASE OF 19% OVER 2021. ADV INCREASED 6% IN THE FOURTH QUARTER TO 21.8 MILLION CONTRACTS, AND ADV INCREASED 7% IN DECEMBER TO 19.2 MILLION CONTRACTS."}{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2023-01-04 09:25:00', 'title': "TOM'S OF MAINE ANNOUNCES 2022 INCUBATOR MEMBERS: FIVE RISING ENVIRONMENTAL LEADERS EACH AWARDED $20K TO SUPPORT THEIR WORK", 'text': "KENNEBUNK, MAINE , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TOM'S OF MAINE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FIVE WINNING MEMBERS OF THE 2022 TOM'S OF MAINE INCUBATOR , INCLUDING ALIYAH COLLINS (24), WAWA GATHERU (24), ALEXIA LECLERCQ (22), BODHI PATIL (20), AND SANJANA PAUL (25). \xa0 EACH RECIPIENT HAS BEEN AWARDED $20,000 IN FUNDING TO HELP SUPPORT THEIR WORK, PLUS ACCESS TO EXPERT MENTORS AND OPPORTUNITIES TO COLLABORATE WITH AND RECEIVE SUPPORT FROM TOM'S OF MAINE IN AMPLIFYING THEIR WORK IN SUSTAINA